<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Klabin started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Klabin started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Fator Securities said in a report it initiated Brazilian pulp and paper manufacturer Industrias Klabin de Papel e Celulose with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- It said a recent downtrend in Klabin share prices offer a &quot;great opportunity to ride on fundamental growth.&quot;</p>
<p>-- It set a 12-month target price of 1,250 reais per 1,000 shares, 39 percent over current levels.</p>
<p>-- Klabin preferred stock was up 3.19 percent at 0.97 real per share or 970 reais per lot of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
